\`\`\`markdown
## Orchestrator Log – [Date]

| Timestamp | Agent            | Action  | Status          | Note               |
| --------- | ---------------- | ------- | --------------- | ------------------ |
| [time]    | Business Analyst | Start   | -               | Input: [reference] |
| [time]    | Business Analyst | Handoff | READY / BLOCKED | [detail]           |
\`\`\`

